flowchart TD
    Signal[Provider/Ubi health signal] --> Scope[Scope provider, app, capability, tenants, time]
    Scope --> Pause[Stop unsafe retries; degraded or paused mode]
    Pause --> Classify[Accepted / failed / unknown / not attempted]
    Classify --> Fallback[Direct Ubi link, phone and manual booking fallback]
    Classify --> Repair[Credential, adapter, provider or policy repair]
    Repair --> Probe{Official capability and health verified?}
    Probe -- No --> Pause
    Probe -- Yes --> Reconcile[Reconcile gaps and unknown outcomes]
    Reconcile --> Replay[Bounded fair policy-valid backlog replay]
    Replay --> Verify[Delivery evidence, bookings, cost and complaints]
    Verify --> Normal[Normal mode + merchant resolution report]

